L	Elite	Sangheili. The Covenant's warrior caste and its field officers: tall, fast, and protected by a recharging energy shield. They command the lesser races, roll out of grenade blasts, and fall back to let their shields return before pressing again. Their armor color tells their rank.
L	FloodArmored	An armoured Marine taken by the Flood, its plating cracked open by the growth beneath. It fights with whatever it was carrying, rocket launchers and sniper rifles included.
L	FloodCarrier	A bloated Flood form that carries infection forms inside it and bursts when it dies or reaches its prey. Kill it at range.
L	FloodElite	A Sangheili host taken by the Flood. Its energy shield still works, and it hits harder than any human form.
L	FloodGrunt	An Unggoy taken by the Flood, bloated around a sack of infection forms. Small and fast, it rushes in to claw at you, and bursts when it dies, letting out the infection forms it carried. Kill it before it reaches you.
L	FloodHuman	A human host taken by the Flood: a former Marine, still wearing its armor, still able to fire the weapon in its grip. It is fast, savage, and rarely stays down.
L	FloodInfection	The Flood's infection form: a small, balloon-like parasite that moves in swarms, latches onto a host and rewrites it from within. Alone it dies to a blow; in hundreds it overwhelms. It will also seek out the dead.
L	FloodJuggernaut	A hulking tank form grown from the biomass of many hosts, nearly twice a Hunter's height, with a heavy carapace and long, scything arms. It carries no weapon and needs none: it charges, leaps across the room onto its prey and smashes whatever it reaches. It shrugs off small-arms fire; bring heavy weapons, keep moving and never let it close the distance.
L	FloodMarine	A Marine taken by the Flood in fatigues and no armour, its own head lolling on its shoulder while the Flood's grows from its chest.
L	FloodODST	An Orbital Drop Shock Trooper taken by the Flood, still in its black armour. Tougher than the other human forms, and it still knows how to use the rifle, shotgun or sniper rifle it died with.
